# Local secrets for `astro dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in.
# Non-secret config goes in wrangler.jsonc `vars`; in staging/production these keys become
# Workers Secrets (`wrangler secret put`).

# Nothing is required locally. The signed-in identity comes from wrangler.jsonc's `access.dev`
# block, not from an environment variable — change the email there to see your own name in the
# audit log (D-029).

# Only needed if you point local dev at a real Access application instead of the dev identity.
# CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=example.cloudflareaccess.com
# CF_ACCESS_AUD=
